That's not true. Ludios itself maybe between 18-22 (apparently every level
has to have 'level number' attached to it, even if it is fully disconnected
from the dungeon), but the portal can be earlier (I had a game where it was
on 13...). The location is apparently decided 'on the fly' - when you enter
a new level the game may decide to generate the portal on it. There might
be an 'upper limit' on where earliest can the portal be (few months ago one
of the dev. team members told me it was level 11 - could have changed since).

